{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0323_1000_p", "source_sha256": "13f5f4c45ef80023264513260bd74570196321a6e876e349bba8662579f562c8", "ja": "（今日は大みそか。劇場のアイドル達と、\n除夜の鐘を突きに行く予定だ……）", "zh": "（今天是除夕。预定要和剧场的偶像们一起去敲除夜钟……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0323_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "119e54c997fbf28782d6a66206b877d2f7d619952a8d7708a27e0d8656c9aad0", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです！\n仕事はどうですか？　終わりそうですか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了！\n工作怎么样？快结束了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0323_1002_p", "source_sha256": "7efe803fbc17c2f914e480ee0fb45b955a933d1324b663ffabd445935e03f6f0", "ja": "百合子？　お疲れさま。どうにかなりそうだよ。", "zh": "百合子？辛苦了。应该能想办法解决。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0323_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "49e08dbbf534c38223022c4e3b6f180b536777dcf10b81a8fb083c8f7990a2e5", "ja": "それならよかったです！\n私、もう今から、楽しみで楽しみで……♪", "zh": "那就太好了！\n我从现在开始就一直期待着，真的好期待……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0323_1004_026yur", "source_sha256": "25a7fbd80cb2c487b624812f29bcc4b9dccbc28968938f71cc9a408a5229a48f", "ja": "夜に出掛けるのって、すっごくワクワク\nしますよね？　冒険の始まりみたいな……特別感が！", "zh": "晚上出门真的超级让人兴奋\n对吧？就像冒险即将开始一样……那种特别的感觉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0323_1005_p", "source_sha256": "e2fa975dadb3db2d0a67c9e193990d7f0c943e717b4810f16faf0d858045c536", "ja": "そうだな。実際に特別な日だし。\nお祭り気分にはなれるよな。", "zh": "是啊。毕竟今天确实是特别的日子。\n也能让人有种过节的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0323_1006_026yur", "source_sha256": "1a61ac1c58c7a6a1bdf565bfa020ece37ca9caf2ba7606e120ba4d2d5b286745", "ja": "ですね！　縁日とかも出ますし。\n焼きそばに、たこ焼き、りんご飴……はぁ♪", "zh": "对呀！还会有庙会之类的。炒面、章鱼烧、苹果糖……啊♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0323_1007_p", "source_sha256": "d4bb6b14a0144133754fb0616bb9eea3b8fd60c3f60db002f0c73b5c1a27b01b", "ja": "はは。一年間、頑張ってくれた感謝を込めて、\nご馳走しようか。好きなもの食べていいぞ！", "zh": "哈哈。为了感谢你这一年来的努力，我请你吃顿好的吧。想吃什么都可以！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0323_1008_026yur", "source_sha256": "ab77fd406c11c52f0b219e830d5292fa713b6033776357f32706453abb78c123", "ja": "本当ですか！？　わぁ、ありがとうございます♪\nあっ、でも……歯止めがきかなくなりそう……。", "zh": "真的吗！？哇，谢谢您♪  \n啊，不过……感觉会控制不住自己……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0323_1009_026yur", "source_sha256": "ac2122417fb09cea53f9b5968ca925623da42ad65addea7fe91fae00e5bb98df", "ja": "お祭りの縁日は、魔物なんです！\n鐘をつく前に、煩悩が溢れちゃいそうで……。", "zh": "祭典的庙会可是魔物！\n感觉还没敲钟，欲念就要满溢出来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0323_1010_026yur", "source_sha256": "ca8a23bd8e86870e96b014904da43b2218a2446648255a903c42fda98e4070dc", "ja": "ステージの衣装がキツくて着られない、\nなんてことになったら……う、ううっ。", "zh": "要是到了穿不上舞台服装的地步……呜、呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0323_1011_p", "source_sha256": "c2b84800a00960e34417690f5296d7815b8f5161265ec295339effb6659ce720", "ja": "まあ、そこはほどほどに……。ああ、それと。\n結構並ぶと思うから、準備はしっかりしていこうな！", "zh": "好啦，稍微注意适量就好……啊，还有。\n我想排队的人会挺多的，所以要好好做好准备哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0323_1012_026yur", "source_sha256": "c1c4ba2f691fde904007b2b2674a4bfe675248150cf773ee76387aa70feebae3", "ja": "あ、はい、その点については、大丈夫です！\n{$P$}さんが一緒ですから。", "zh": "啊，好的，关于这点没问题！\n有{$P$}先生陪着我一起嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0323_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "1503670c2fb7471ec0f2eb82822ddc50034377f1e254f8a4cd56ad37fd2a0cd9", "ja": "お喋りしていると、いつも時間が早く過ぎるので。\n何時間でも待てちゃいそう……なんて。", "zh": "因为聊着天的时候，时间总是过得很快。\n感觉就算等上几个小时也能等下去……什么的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0323_1014_p", "source_sha256": "9840cdc660d00fcea9622f388fa4a7332fe79e8f2da362b311748917ee8a4ecb", "ja": "いや、何時間も待たされたら困るけど……寒そうだし。", "zh": "不是，真要让我等上几个小时可就麻烦了……而且看起来挺冷的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0323_1015_026yur", "source_sha256": "1fc62b06cab46a504ab216b59580eab506393b2845911388d76fdbb444f03e25", "ja": "寒そう？　……そう、私が寒そうにしていると、\n{$P$}さんが、そっと手を……。", "zh": "看起来很冷？　……对，要是我显得很冷的话，\n{$P$}先生就会轻轻把手……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0323_1016_026yur", "source_sha256": "e9ad572c1b2981cc8686a90e0607a7753899b872446496eb191d0ab408254486", "ja": "はっ！？　だ、ダメ！　これは……\n大みそかのせいで、私の煩悩が増幅されて……！？", "zh": "啊！？ 不、不行！ 这、这是因为除夕夜，我的烦恼被放大了……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0323_1017_026yur", "source_sha256": "cbce1a18b0e7a381ba33d7676953150871d30242a2c55d80aa780cd6cf7f13c5", "ja": "{$P$}さん、は、早く行きましょう！\nすぐに鐘をつかないと、大変なことになります……！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，我、我们快走吧！\n要是不赶紧去敲钟，就要出大事了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
